			"text": "Narrated Jabir ibn Samurah: When I came to the Prophet (ﷺ) in his house, I saw him sitting reclining on a pillow. The narrator Ibn al-Jarrah added: \"on his left side\". Abu Dawud said: Ishaq b. Mansur transmitted it from Isra'il, also mentioning the words \"on his left side",
